  "title": "What the CMS Interim Final Rule Means for Health Plans and Health Systems",
  "summary": "In June 2026, CMS released the interim final rule implementing the new Medicaid community engagement requirement created by Section 71119 of the Working Families Tax Cut (WFTC) legislation. This is the most significant change to Medicaid eligibility since expansion, and it introduces a work-or-activity requirement as a condition of coverage for many adult Medicaid members.",
